      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW TREACLE (8) was well supported last time and ran up to expectations, burning early to score a 2 length win at Horsham over 410m in 23.53. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from three starts. One of the key runners again. PAW ZOHAN (2) was safely held in tougher company last start after settling well back at this track, but prior to that won by 1.5 lengths at this track (22.82) beating Turbo Tilly in a Mix 6/7 on October 2. Has never missed the frame from three starts from this draw, including a win. Has the ability to give this a shake. STOJANOVIC (5) was safely held last time out, finishing fifth at Shepparton over 390m behind Elite Intention (22.79) in a Grade 5. Placed at his previous run. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. Can figure in the finish. I'M HONEY (1) looks an each-way chance.",
